flowchart TD
    I[Request + context + history + catalog] --> P[Planner: ordered tool list, once]
    P --> L[Code keeps plan order and repeated tool slots]
    L --> N{Slots remaining?}
    N -->|no| D[Stop: done / plan exhausted]
    N -->|yes| C[Caller: current tool schema, select args and values]
    C -->|call arguments| V[env.validate]
    V -->|valid and within budget| E[env.call: tool name fixed by plan]
    E -->|success: actual observation| A[Advance one slot]
    A --> N
    C -->|skip: branch inapplicable| A
    C -->|ask params for current tool| Q[sys.ask_missing_info then stop]
    C -->|blocked| B[Stop: caller_blocked]
    V -->|invalid| X[Stop: failure]
    E -->|failure or done=false| X
    E -->|duplicate / no progress / budget| X
